    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a platform jumping game. You must avoid random spikes or traps to reach the finish line and defeat the BOSS through specific rules! The gameplay is simple and more casual!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/af845c5ea52bfb349f9146c25af76695.avif?t=1751380854\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Introduction to gameplay</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Avoid enemies, avoid spikes, and avoid traps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. There are many types of Bosses, and specific rules must be used to defeat them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/40e73b6a58d760a17c568d982953f31b.poster.avif?t=1751380854\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/40e73b6a58d760a17c568d982953f31b.apng?t=1751380854\" class=\"bb_img\" width=264 height=200 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Role introduction</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Move left and right, jump, accelerate sprint!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. You can sprint to avoid enemy attacks or spikes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/18a8f36cd500f467081aa03c6471b9a1.poster.avif?t=1751380854\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/18a8f36cd500f467081aa03c6471b9a1.apng?t=1751380854\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Introduction to subsequent level gameplay</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. New levels will be updated regularly in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Each level will have a specific way to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. There will be various ways to defeat the final BOSS of each level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/6dd147e5ffe5cba7992394e133698fb0.avif?t=1751380854\" width=640 height=360 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/e6500c0802efb1ef2e69aa06ce218910.avif?t=1751380854\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a platform jumping game. You must avoid random spikes or traps to reach the finish line and defeat the BOSS through specific rules! The gameplay is simple and more casual!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/af845c5ea52bfb349f9146c25af76695.avif?t=1751380854\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Introduction to gameplay</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Avoid enemies, avoid spikes, and avoid traps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. There are many types of Bosses, and specific rules must be used to defeat them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/40e73b6a58d760a17c568d982953f31b.poster.avif?t=1751380854\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/40e73b6a58d760a17c568d982953f31b.apng?t=1751380854\" class=\"bb_img\" width=264 height=200 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Role introduction</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Move left and right, jump, accelerate sprint!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. You can sprint to avoid enemy attacks or spikes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/18a8f36cd500f467081aa03c6471b9a1.poster.avif?t=1751380854\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/18a8f36cd500f467081aa03c6471b9a1.apng?t=1751380854\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Introduction to subsequent level gameplay</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. New levels will be updated regularly in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Each level will have a specific way to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. There will be various ways to defeat the final BOSS of each level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/6dd147e5ffe5cba7992394e133698fb0.avif?t=1751380854\" width=640 height=360 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/e6500c0802efb1ef2e69aa06ce218910.avif?t=1751380854\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p>",
